### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

###
GET http://localhost:8080/room/list
###
GET http://localhost:8080/room/1
###
GET http://localhost:8080/seat/list
###
GET http://localhost:8080/seat/list?roomId=1
###
GET http://localhost:8080/seat/1
###
GET http://localhost:8080/seat/available?seatId=1&date=2026-10-20
###
GET http://localhost:8080/seat/available?seatId=1&date=2026-10-21
###
### 成功预约：座位1，2026-10-20，第 8~11 格
POST http://localhost:8080/reservation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "seatId": 1, "date": "2026-10-20", "startSlot": 8, "endSlot": 12 }
###
### 缺 date → 应该 400 + {"code":400,"message":"参数不完整..."}
POST http://localhost:8080/reservation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "seatId": 1, "startSlot": 8, "endSlot": 12 }
### ① 先约一个：座位1，2026-11-10，第 8~12 格
POST http://localhost:8080/reservation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "seatId": 1, "date": "2026-11-10", "startSlot": 8, "endSlot": 12 }

### ② 查可用时段 —— 8,9,10,11 应该【不在】列表里
GET http://localhost:8080/seat/available?seatId=1&date=2026-11-10

### ③ 取消它（假设 ① 返回的 id 是 1）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/reservation/1

### ④ ★关键验证：再查可用时段 —— 8,9,10,11 应该【回来了】
GET http://localhost:8080/seat/available?seatId=1&date=2026-11-10

### ⑤ 重复取消 —— 应该报"只有已预约的订单可以取消"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/reservation/1
### ① 约【今天】的时段：slot 4~5（12:00-13:00）
POST http://localhost:8080/reservation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "seatId": 1, "date": "2026-10-26", "startSlot":7, "endSlot":9 }

### ② 签到（假设 ① 返回 id=1）→ 应该成功 200
POST http://localhost:8080/reservation/2/checkin

### ③ 重复签到 → 应该报"当前状态【CHECKED_IN】不允许签到"
POST http://localhost:8080/reservation/1/checkin

### ④ 已签到的去取消 → 应该报"当前状态【CHECKED_IN】不允许取消"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/reservation/1

### ⑤ 约【明天】的时段，然后签到 → 应该报"还没到时间"
POST http://localhost:8080/reservation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "seatId": 2, "date": "2026-10-27", "startSlot": 4, "endSlot": 6 }
###
GET http://localhost:8080/seat/available?seatId=3&date=2026-10-26
