GET http://localhost:8080/stat/room-usage?date=2026-10-27


### 最热时段 TOP5
GET http://localhost:8080/stat/slot-heat?date=2026-10-27
###
GET http://localhost:8080/stat/room-usage?date=2026-10-28
###
GET http://localhost:8080/stat/slot-heat?date=2026-10-28
